---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Delete Account — TesterLoop"
  description="How to permanently delete your TesterLoop Hub account and associated data."
  canonicalPath="/delete-account"
>
  <article class="card">
    <h1>Account Deletion (Google Play &amp; LGPD)</h1>
    <p>You can delete your account directly inside the TesterLoop Hub app under <strong>Settings → Delete account</strong>, which immediately triggers <code>delete_user_account()</code> and cascades removal of your profile, device hashes, enrollments, and ledger entries.</p>
    <p>If you no longer have access to the app, request deletion via your registered Google account email.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
